# Pier 7's "low side" (Jenkem, 2021: where you ollie onto the ledges to manual): on the seawall level
# the blocks stand 0.25 m. Rolling south-east across the plaza between the second and third blocks,
# an ollie onto the third one's middle and a manual across its width, rolled off its far side
# (0.37 m down to the plaza's ramp there), landed clean.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport 578.37 925.07 -9.05 144.5
cmd 2 set skater.vel.x 2.320
cmd 2 set skater.vel.y -3.258
hold ollie 105..117
tap up 194
tap down 198
bot balance
run 330
expect event land{quality=clean} within 198..204
expect event manualStart{trick=Manual} within 198..204
expect event air within 216..226
expect event land{quality=clean} within 250..260
expect no event bail
